# The Resulting Architecture

Lesson Set 01 establishes the following general pipeline:

```text
                    ┌── PIR ──────────┐
                    │                 │
Arduino + Sensor →  │                 ├── Motion Fusion ──→ Motion State
                    │                 │
                    └── RCWL ─────────┘


                    ┌── Ultrasonic ───┐
                    │                 │
Arduino + Sensor →  │                 ├── Distance Fusion ──→ Distance State
                    │                 │
                    └── ToF ──────────┘
```

Device discovery sits underneath the individual sensor pipelines:

```text
USB
 ↓
VID/PID
 ↓
Candidate Device
 ↓
EEPROM Metadata
 ↓
EID + TYPE + SENSOR
 ↓
Correct ROS 2 Entry Node
```

This separates **physical device identity** from the ROS 2 processing pipeline.

