# How to Work Through This Set

Work through the modules in order.

1. Build the PIR module.
2. Write its EEPROM identity.
3. Test the PIR Arduino sketch.
4. Test PIR ROS 2 discovery and `/pir_state`.
5. Build and test the RCWL module.
6. Write its EEPROM identity.
7. Test RCWL ROS 2 discovery and `/rcwl_state`.
8. Build and test Motion Fusion.
9. Build and test the Ultrasonic module.
10. Test `/ultrasonic_distance`.
11. Build and test the ToF module.
12. Test `/tof_distance`.
13. Build and test Distance Fusion.
14. Build and test the Motion State Node.
15. Build and test the Distance State Node.

Do not move to fusion until the individual sensor pipelines work.

Do not move to the state layer until the fusion layer works.

