# Troubleshooting During the Lesson

When changing a ROS 2 Python node, remember:

```text
Edit → Build → Source → Run
```

For example:

```bash
cd ~/rpi_ws
colcon build --packages-select droidworks_sensors
source install/setup.bash
```

Then run the node.

ROS 2 may otherwise execute the previously installed version of the Python package.

See the project's troubleshooting documentation for common build, installation, serial, and discovery problems.

