# What Lesson Set 01 Establishes

When Lesson Set 01 is complete, Droid Works USA has a working modular sensor layer.

The important separation is:

```text
Physical Sensors
      ↓
Device Identity
      ↓
Device Discovery
      ↓
Individual ROS 2 Topics
      ↓
Fusion
      ↓
State
      ↓
Higher-Level Modules
```

Each layer has a specific job.

The individual sensor nodes do not need to know what the OLED is doing.

The OLED does not need to know which USB port the sensor is connected to.

The state nodes do not need to know whether motion came from PIR, RCWL, or eventually another sensor array.

That separation is intentional.

